This is what our Sages, of blessed memory, said (Bava Basra 10a): “One who has no children should gladden his wife with a matter of mitzvah.” For a woman is called a foot, as it is written (1 Samuel 1:9): “The feet [

raglay

] of His pious ones He guards” (see Zohar, Va'yaira 112a).
